    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#659826ee7adb242c20b6f3f1889fe25953f13389a0d0d835867afef132571684</id>
    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-09T00:38:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Keep potatoes away from onions: onions release moisture and gases that can encourage potatoes to sprout sooner. A cool, dark, ventilated cupboard suits potatoes better.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#59bc59bd7c53e382121661a77fdf79694678753af2e96a3bc3b549c151e2ed65</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-09T00:38:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Public libraries lend more than books: many offer tool-lending collections, letting neighbours share drills and other occasional-use kit instead of each household buying its own.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#21dce3d33b94ac23aef4317c5e50d37af496756452a6ffc2a63cf20c80cf788f</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-09T00:38:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">On your next visit to a park, library or community hall, take a moment to check its noticeboard and straighten one slipped flyer so useful local information stays visible.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
